    - character:
        name: Anna
        icon: {fileID: 1981243993, guid: 4f5c943b6d83eb140b9960e777d8f4fe, type: 3}
      line: "Please don\u2019t kill me\u2026"
    - character:
        name: Timothy
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 93ff86fa36ceb3444b2c45a4307005e5, type: 2}
      line: "I\u2019m here to set you free. What did they do to you?"
    - character:
        name: Anna
        icon: {fileID: 1981243993, guid: 4f5c943b6d83eb140b9960e777d8f4fe, type: 3}
      line: 'I''m a journalist. They call me enemy of the state

        because
        I write the truth.'
    - character:
        name: Timothy
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 93ff86fa36ceb3444b2c45a4307005e5, type: 2}
      line: "Just act natural. I'll open door and just stay near\n me. "
